<!--
  Civilopedia entries for the mod: a dedicated "Emigration" section (pattern from the corpus mod 3640054014 "ORN"),
  organised into page groups like the base game's Game Concepts section. Loaded via the modinfo
  <UpdateDatabase> data ActionGroup, with the text in the game-scope <UpdateText>.

  Two kinds of page live here:

  • The original single-body pages use the base "Concept" layout (one CONTENT chapter) and ONE explicit
    CivilopediaPageChapterParagraphs row pointing at the page's body key in text/<locale>/ModText.xml
    (LOC_PEDIA_EMIG_OVERVIEW_BODY and its siblings), translated like everything else. That table's primary key
    is (Section, Page, Chapter), so it can hold only one paragraph per chapter; those bodies use [n][n] for
    their paragraph breaks.

  • The chaptered pages (Departures & Arrivals, Calling Your People Home, Immigration Policies, Map Lenses, ...)
    use their own EMIG_* layouts below and NO paragraph rows: the pedia then resolves a chapter's title and
    paragraphs by key convention (model-civilopedia.js findChapterTextKey), the page and chapter ids spliced
    into keys shaped like LOC_PEDIA_EMIGRATION_PAGE_ARRIVALS_CHAPTER_LEAVING_TITLE and
    LOC_PEDIA_EMIGRATION_PAGE_ARRIVALS_CHAPTER_LEAVING_PARA_1, then PARA_2 and so on until the first gap,
    with the text in text/en_us/PediaText.xml (en_us only, like EnclaveText.xml). A chapter with no PARA_1 is
    skipped; a chapter with no TITLE row draws untitled (each page's CONTENT opening).

  The "Voices of the Displaced" group's per-civilization pages and the EMIG_VOICES layout are GENERATED into
  data/emigration-civilopedia-voices.xml + text/en_us/PediaVoicesText.xml by scripts/gen-pedia-voices.mjs from the
  quote registries; only the group row and the intro page are here.

  The policy cards have no pedia pages of their own (the base pedia lists no Traditions), so Immigration Policies
  lists them.
-->
<Database>
    <CivilopediaSections>
        <Row SectionID="EMIGRATION" Name="LOC_PEDIA_EMIG_TITLE" Icon="city_add" SortIndex="160"/>
    </CivilopediaSections>

    <CivilopediaPageGroups>
        <Row SectionID="EMIGRATION" PageGroupID="EMIG_TOPICS" Name="LOC_PEDIA_EMIG_GROUP_TITLE" SortIndex="10"/>
        <Row SectionID="EMIGRATION" PageGroupID="EMIG_SYSTEMS" Name="LOC_PEDIA_EMIG_GROUP_SYSTEMS_TITLE" SortIndex="20"/>
        <Row SectionID="EMIGRATION" PageGroupID="EMIG_POLICY" Name="LOC_PEDIA_EMIG_GROUP_POLICY_TITLE" SortIndex="30"/>
